{"title":"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered triples of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d9e22097e20a1249b5332202b24941a4bf9e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e408e3684e2ac4166ee224a01403d409eaf2f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/3/b63a2a1fa5c863bd444640ad235bc7aa8ead4942.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc2fcecf9caceb94f707a0f7218f9bf8e4f9ff20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, satisfy both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/0/f3056cbdb8f561c525056db5c9bb0f0e8985ef1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a}b = c^{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/1752f0800b74f9fa5f314f6b0458c28d9f72b786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c = 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"129\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a658cdbc840d9f28f81b4efa23eacc5b0b865f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)} \\ 0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)} \\ 1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)} \\ 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)} \\ 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)} \\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"344\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8aee18467dee74ba653d43b3f8edf561f6692bb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{c^{2005}} = b$\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Casework\" title=\"Casework\">Casework</a> upon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db496a2fade0867e2dedc83ca9cf6262560559a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />: Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/f/99fab2bc419928deb9a3e33867a7d259fb4382c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^0 = b \\Longrightarrow b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />. Thus we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d819584e4f799c65fd66748bfc018a190b2b2a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2004,1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/5351998230e216d9d0f2884c159326cfe6622263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />: Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce38c5747d8bc0f9b2248addba8d67d3f8cf307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^1 = b \\Longrightarrow a = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />. Thus we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a3d9502f1fb35e36b9172e44525fdd4723a2af4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1002,1002,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/c/e6c519570f5d0a43e91e6548d78f173edfb2d5b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />: Then the exponent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> becomes huge, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2cd546ffbb52fe8a7f8e4d1cb3ec38047627e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> there is no way we can satisfy the second condition. Hence we have two ordered triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2484f88154fadcf9c781bba19becdae88696b77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A\">2005 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\